<title>UK: Cadbury year profit up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Cadbury year profit up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>52 weeks to December 28 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		34.1		   vs 31.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 11.8		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 17.0		   vs 16.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     592		    vs 511</p>
<p> Turnover		   5,115		  vs 4,776</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 585.0 and 592.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Cadbury Schweppes Plc.</p>
</text>
